From 7c2e6771d2d55a10bf422da7c465ebd20e0050ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: apranikstar <trialoftheniku@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:50:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] FCCee/ALFA: add ALFA_o1_v01 with ARC barrel and endcaps

ALFA_o1_v00 plus the ARC (ARC_geo_o1_v01 driver) between the outer tracker
and the ECAL: barrel r 1900-2100 mm over 4400 mm, endcaps r 280-1900 mm at
|z| 2000-2200 mm, detector IDs 20/21. Cell optics are referenced from
CLD_o3_v01. The gas radiator is pressurised xenon (Xenon_ARC, 2 bar baseline,
Bideau-Mehu 1981 dispersion scaled with density); the mirror reflectivity is
a constant. ARC colours added to display.xml.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KP5vqAGH2XiGXWtPhaonke
